      "mergeID": "62f15cfdeddb3444bf18b86d",
      "mergedPostDetails": "This is a feature request for the portable mirror to have an option to increase the mirror's resolution/antialiasing, as right now it's a bit blurry and jaggy and pixelated to look at. Which is good for optimization, but an option to set stuff higher would be nice when you're in an instance where you don't need that optimization tradeoff",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1216] Portable Mirror - Add Resolution/Antialiasing Options",
